    "在线模型": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Online models"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "填地址和 Key 后，点「在线模型」会自动从该地址的 /models 接口取回可用模型列表，你挑一个即可，不用记模型名。配好后先点「测试连接」，通了再回去用。不启用则一切在端上完成，笔记不出手机。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After filling in the endpoint and key, tap Online models to fetch the available list from that address's /models endpoint. Pick one, no need to remember model names. Test the connection first. When disabled, everything runs on device and notes never leave the phone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份与恢复": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backup & restore"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份是完整数据（笔记、关联、复习进度），换机或重装后导入即可回到原样。Markdown 导出只保留正文。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A backup is the complete data (notes, links, review progress); import it after switching phones or reinstalling to get back to exactly where you were. Markdown export keeps the body text only."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "复习": {
      "localizations": {
